      "writtenOn": "2023-10-18T07:54:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is it possible to extract this parsing functionality into a separate library? Considering that this information is generated in microdroid and will be used in the baremetal service VM, it would be advantageous to isolate the formatting code from the start to avoid duplicating this effort in the future.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 60,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 60,
        "endChar": 19
