      "writtenOn": "2023-10-31T17:50:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There\u0027s no parsing here.\nI\u0027m slightly reluctant to extract this; it\u0027s a simple local helper, it does exactly what is needed here, and I expect to tweak it a bit when coping with APEXes.\nThe only commonality is the keys in the map, but the source of truth for that is the CDDL.",
